ORDER i) Criminal Writ Petition No.1297 of 2024 is allowed and disposed off;
ii) The proceedings in Special Case No.3225/2024 pending before the Court of Special Judge, Pune arising out of FIR bearing C.R. No.125 of 2024 registered with Bharti Vdyapeeth Police Station,
Pune, is quashed and set aside.

